Package: pulsaros-gnome
Version: 1.0.48
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: gnome-shell, dconf-cli
Description: GNOME Shell extensions and configurations for Pulsar OS.
 Packages selected GNOME extensions and injects GSchema overrides and dconf databases
 to achieve a macOS-like desktop experience in Pulsar OS.
